# Project core

## Monorepo

- `apps/backend` — Express + Prisma (PostgreSQL) API
- `apps/frontend` — React + Vite SPA
- Do not invent a new monorepo tool; keep the current layout

## Scope

- Portfolio foundation: multi-method domain services, Docker Compose (postgres + backend + frontend), API + E2E tests
- PostgreSQL via Prisma in local, Docker, and API tests (`refund_test`)
- No S3 and no extra domain features (approve/reject, etc.) unless explicitly requested
- Human-facing docs: root `README.md`; agent architecture detail: `.cursor/docs/architecture.md`

## Secrets & env

- Never commit real secrets (`.env` with real JWT/password keys)
- Use `.env.example` placeholders only
- JWT secret and API URLs come from environment, not hardcoded literals

## Language

- Chat and explanations with the user: Portuguese (pt-BR)
- Commit messages, PR titles/bodies, code identifiers, and code comments: English
